id: pm-graph-maint1014
title: Enable the gated GitHub issue sync and drop the braces chain
description: Enable the SHA-pinned fail-closed issue sync caller and remove fast-glob by adopting published pm-ops 2026.10.14. Keep existing thresholds and verify isolated npm and Bun release gates. This combined maintenance chore implements the dependency remediation tracked by pm-graph-g8uc and leaves those items open for verification.
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[1]: changed
created_at: "2026-10-14T09:49:43.707Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T10:56:45.533Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:03:38.218Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:03:38.218Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Reverified main f46704ef4083 (unchanged since audit): The SHA-pinned .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml caller is present on main; current package.json also records the adopted toolchain. Runtime workflow failures are a separate concern. Retained evidence: .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml, package.json, package-lock.json."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T09:49:52.694Z",codex-agent,"Plan: author this package own thin caller, pin workflow SHA and pm-github to 2026.10.13, and verify isolated npm/Bun release gates without changing thresholds. Remove fast-glob and any jscpd4 alias; pin pm-ops 2026.10.14. Published changelog reviewed: attestation alias/function rejection, read-only pack prepare, release repair and Windows proof support. Duplication now uses Node glob with jscpd 5. No workflow dispatch, bot requests, merges, or source function changes."
  "2026-10-14T09:50:54.042Z",codex-agent,"Audit before: full 4 vulnerabilities (4 high), production 0. After: full 0, production 0; npm ls braces is empty. The caller runs at 17 2 * * * UTC. It validates access, previews the complete plan, imports with --gate, verifies repeat-import idempotency and privacy, then checks strict health before commit/push/PR. SHA pin matches published pm-github 2026.10.13. Actionlint skipped: binary missing and offline npx registry metadata unavailable. GitHub Actions PR-creation setting verified enabled. No direct fast-glob imports in authored scripts; no runtime function change or behavioural revert test applies."
  "2026-10-14T09:52:03.243Z",codex-agent,"Adapted this package own prepare launcher to the published artifact-time contract by editing its original source, without copying another consumer repo file. Added a regression for pack/publish with pinned and stale installers: exit 0, one skip notice, byte-identical Git config. Focused regression passes 1/1; reverting only the launcher makes it fail, then fixed source restored. Existing install/ci failure checks remain covered."
  "2026-10-14T10:31:18.772Z",codex-agent,"Found an obsolete workflow assertion: the sync file was required to run the local installer, but the requested thin caller delegates installation to the audited reusable workflow. Retained the CI installer assertion and added caller checks for the exact SHA/version, own 02:17 schedule, dispatch, permissions and absence of local steps/disable guards. Focused caller regression passes 1/1; restoring only the previous disabled workflow fails it, then new caller restored. Full gate results and any further failures will be inspected before rerunning."
  "2026-10-14T11:05:27.906Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: npm: 322/322 tests passed, 0 skipped; bun: 322/322 tests passed, 0 skipped. Both isolated release:check gates passed at unchanged thresholds. Full audit 0, production audit 0, npm ls braces empty. Caller identity check reports only unbraind/pm-github. Behavioural revert proof: artifact-prepare regression passes 1/1 and fails when only the previous launcher is restored. Changelog regenerated and checked. Actionlint unavailable offline as recorded above. Item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-15T12:35:51.827Z",claude-hub,"Repin to pm-github 2026.10.15 (3015930) failed CI: test/install-pm-github.test.ts asserted the literal pin a0880e9 and version 2026.10.13, so every future pm-github repin would fail this test (same trap as pm-vcs-15ab). The test now asserts the pin's shape (40-hex SHA annotated '# pm-github <release>') and that pm-github-version names that same release. Local: node --test test/install-pm-github.test.ts 5/5."
